{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38866","headline":"秋日闲居寄先达 · 杜荀鹤","name":"秋日闲居寄先达","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"到头身事欲何爲，窗下工夫鬓上知。\n乍可百年无称意，难教一日不吟诗。\n风驱早鴈冲湖色，雨挫残蝉点柳枝。\n自古书生也如此，独堪惆怅是明时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}